  "macroRenderedOutput": {},
  "body": {
    "storage": {
      "value": "<ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"info\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"d35c02e1-c856-4371-869d-8c087083abe5\"><ac:rich-text-body><p>These reports are available only from Odoo 16 integration.</p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><p>With Odoo 16 Integration, custom reports have been created to gather data on various areas such as sales, inventory, and discounts. The reports primarily use Excel format, with a few also available in PDF. These reports are consolidated within a module called <a href=\"https://github.com/Bahmni/bahmni-odoo-modules/tree/main/bahmni_reports\">Bahmni Custom Reports</a> and are preinstalled in the <code>bahmni/odoo-16</code> docker image.</p><h3>Accessing the reports</h3><p>All of the custom reports can be accessed from <code>Menu -&gt; Reports --&gt; Custom Reports</code> navigation.</p><ac:image ac:align=\"center\" ac:layout=\"center\" ac:original-height=\"518\" ac:original-width=\"1790\" ac:custom-width=\"true\" ac:alt=\"image-20240812-152230.png\" ac:width=\"1329\"><ri:attachment ri:filename=\"image-20240812-152230.png\" ri:version-at-save=\"1\" /></ac:image><p>Every report necessitates particular inputs. For instance, stock movement reports require details on the source stock location and destination stock location. Additionally, the reports can be filtered for a specific product or drug within the reports.</p><p />",
      "representation": "storage",
      "embeddedContent": [],
      "_expandable": {
        "content": "/rest/api/content/3690168321"
      }
    },
    "view": {
      "value": "<div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-information conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"d35c02e1-c856-4371-869d-8c087083abe5\" data-macro-name=\"info\"><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-info confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p>These reports are available only from Odoo 16 integration.</p></div></div><p>With Odoo 16 Integration, custom reports have been created to gather data on various areas such as sales, inventory, and discounts. The reports primarily use Excel format, with a few also available in PDF. These reports are consolidated within a module called <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://github.com/Bahmni/bahmni-odoo-modules/tree/main/bahmni_reports\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bahmni Custom Reports</a> and are preinstalled in the <code>bahmni/odoo-16</code> docker image.</p><h3 id=\"CustomReportsinOdoo16-Accessingthereports\">Accessing the reports</h3><p>All of the custom reports can be accessed from <code>Menu -&gt; Reports --&gt; Custom Reports</code> navigation.</p><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image image-center\" alt=\"image-20240812-152230.png\" width=\"1329\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/3690168321/image-20240812-152230.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1723476156918&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1329&amp;height=384\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/3690168321/image-20240812-152230.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1723476156918&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-height=\"518\" data-width=\"1790\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"3690397698\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"image-20240812-152230.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"3690168321\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"1\" data-media-id=\"0f5e25c2-99d0-4ef6-aa09-bb1ebd7a2ed1\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/3690168321/image-20240812-152230.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1723476156918&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=2658&amp;height=768 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/3690168321/image-20240812-152230.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1723476156918&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1329&amp;height=384 1x\"></span><p>Every report necessitates particular inputs. For instance, stock movement reports require details on the source stock location and destination stock location. Additionally, the reports can be filtered for a specific product or drug within the reports.</p><p />",
